Z||000006||Oreif||10-17-2000||02:29 AM||||If I remember correctly, The purple pavement eater was a fastback that was cut and modified by it's owner. (Archie was/is not the owner) If you see pics from the side you'll notice the angle and curve are unique.<BR>The owner has passed on. He was a well respected member of our local club. Archie has it on his site to list it for sale. I think the kit is Archies kit but the work was all done by the owner. I have seen the car in person and it is a very very nice car with lots of custom "one of a kind" work on it.||||reg||1
